CO-WORKING SPACE WEBSITE
FULL VISUAL, CONTENT & STRUCTURE SPECIFICATION
(NUXT 3 + NUXT UI ONLY)

================================================
1. GENERAL RULES
================================================
Framework: Nuxt 3
UI Library: Nuxt UI ONLY (no custom UI libraries)
Coding style: Clean, component-based, reusable
Layout: Vertical scrolling, full-width sections
Responsiveness: Desktop, Tablet, Mobile
Animations: Minimal, smooth (optional fade-in)

------------------------------------------------
IMPORTANT
------------------------------------------------
• Do NOT invent copy.
• Use the exact words provided below.
• Images and layout positioning are PRIORITY.
• Nuxt UI components must be used strictly.

================================================
2. GLOBAL APP STRUCTURE
================================================

<AppLayout>
 ├─ Fixed Header
 ├─ Main Scroll Area
 │   ├─ Hero Section
 │   ├─ Features Grid
 │   ├─ Image + Text Split
 │   ├─ Amenities Grid
 │   ├─ Pricing Cards
 │   └─ Contact Section
 └─ Footer
</AppLayout>

All sections wrapped in UContainer.

